From 8dbc6ff0bf21425434cbad875b767c0e0ef71afd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Forb Hidden Gems <348521123+ForbHiddenGems@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:24:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 27/28] Battle digivolution: Champions and Ultimates too,
 unlocked by tamer rank

A Rookie digivolves to its Champion at any tamer rank, a Champion to its
Ultimate from rank 5 (Pro), an Ultimate to its Mega from rank 8
(Commander). Megas don't. The step is the one the Digimon's digivolution
table names at its DP, as before; below the rank needed the DP gauge
stays empty.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
