 /* Battle digivolution (Forbs Hidden Mods, native only; src/stag3000/evo_native.inc, built into
  * battle.c). Each party Digimon has an energy bar that fills as it deals and takes damage. Full,
- * a Rookie that has a Champion form gets a third command, Digivolve: the Digi-Lab's digivolution
- * effect plays on the battlefield and it fights as its Champion form (model, animations, stronger
- * stats) for 3 turns, then returns. The battle copy of the Digimon changes; the party in the save
+ * a Rookie, Champion or Ultimate with a form one level up gets a third command, Digivolve (Rookie
+ * at any tamer rank, Champion from rank 5, Ultimate from rank 8): the Digi-Lab's digivolution
+ * effect plays on the battlefield and it fights as that form (model, animations, stronger stats)
+ * for 3 turns, then returns. The battle copy of the Digimon changes; the party in the save
  * never does (it is reverted before the battle writes back). F1 > Forbs Hidden Mods toggles it. */
 
 #ifdef DW2_NATIVE
diff --git a/src/stag3000/battle.c b/src/stag3000/battle.c
